      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The management of an obese patient involves a multidisciplinary team. The psychological dimension often plays an important role in weight gain and must be taken into account early on in the care pathway. The support given to the patient must notably involve work on body image and how this changes as a result of bariatric surgery."
      },
